				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1361b25
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i>the art of boxing</i>, <i><span class="en">
